Hi {{first_name}},

An account has been set up for you on the {{college_name}} system. You can use it to see your timetable, attendance and courses, and to hand in work.

  Username: {{username}}
  Temporary password: {{password}}

Please sign in and change your password straight away. Nobody from the college will ever ask you for it.

If you weren't expecting this email, reply and let us know.

{{college_name}}
